# Density Compare
# Dysprosium (Dy) — real density 8.54 g/cm³. equal masses: Dysprosium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Dysprosium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.8mm color: #a6ffff at (-20mm, 4.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 68.1 g — the water cube is the reference
